  "problemStatement": "Find parametric equations for the line segment from P(-1, 3) to Q(5, 7) for 0 <= t <= 1.",
  "finalAnswer": "x(t) = -1 + 6t, \\quad y(t) = 3 + 4t, \\quad t \\in [0, 1]",
