      "title": "Use Linear Interpolation Formula",
      "mathExpression": "x(t) = x_0 + t(x_1 - x_0), \\quad y(t) = y_0 + t(y_1 - y_0)",
      "explanation": "Standard vector parametric formulation.",
      "why": "Line segment interpolation."
